{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1434,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0edcb5084f7b3ca68022eee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我中午都是吃便当。\r\n做便当的过程很开心……\r\n最棒的是能自由带去任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93341af72b5d70c7efda8b6c07f960dadceaa12bbb2e0c67323241e04d3e8c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58056fa8e3aed53607c2066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，远方传来了进王的声音……\r\n呵呵呵，她真是一道能让人从午睡中\r\n清醒，卷起漫天樱花的强风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efcffcfc45d36ef428fa00c2649cef4c742918470ba43ca5c8c12751be8011ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826948ccd89be6482c091275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的森林会传来各种声音。\r\n虫、鸟、兽、夜风……\r\n呵呵，风声当然算是一种声音呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e74a60003b2c1641dc3dade2cfb43561d543dc2fb9920f6afba96ff4da12534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1457b9f809be38a0559320e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上散步非常舒服，\r\n但父母曾经骂我这样太缺乏戒心……\r\n我是不是该稍微节制一点呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb3da5b31d6a2714d91380c8d5b1725740e1f3349e04215ef6aeb6822b50e38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00aeaff7b3b864c07814cf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "古人曾说东风一吹，花香便来……\r\n这味道真的很棒呢。\r\n是小花种的花吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fb8a4a3e4d3ce3bd6442af2c36913be02dc748d94ad287fe2887a742fe7e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7881e56b3c130c22206cb0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我趁着早晨凉爽出门散步时，\r\n晨风从背后推了我一把，\r\n让我有动力能在炎热的天气里努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbbc7929e5488ed04ef1a0cc6815f5d684536b4b5aac8f529af3ca9e586d9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6548df203e0e0da1480c6f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是适合登山的季节……红叶\r\n当然很棒，但我总觉得越接近冬天，\r\n山中的景色也变得越发艳丽呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbe3d39e82ff5763557c1e94c67f71b6a2cf0fde4cc89c188d5d9e3c6391a31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac2413f5de066eafa501c0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连手指因秋风而冻僵的冰凉感触，\r\n都让人感到怜爱……\r\n现在就是这样的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b674ea2231e230795ced8a8f00bed697050f89a74486d3a6194dfb75210f5413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830495d60995a6f6c857661c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐烤的司康饼，要来一块吗？\r\n这是带着麦香的凉风拂过鼻尖时，\r\n我做出来的自信之作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "992c42ed2418ab3b212757598cda0e6b220b1c2e712228d904c0cf3a0917729e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:376201c34de6ab62d8138c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在寻找夜晚残留的香气时，\r\n清晨却已悄然弥漫开来。\n呵呵，真是个急性子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe21052158d908ba9b5eea2a76d81b32d108816650370d9bb4e5318588e8f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee47c713ae30303697cc9264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "罪恶的轻风……不仅把杂念，\r\n还把上课的内容从记忆中吹跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e4851bc65b3d2e004a11024d4c88102c58a8e6441948a16c27b161c6da7254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b29c16a5c580cb9a276c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以来帮我做下午的点心吗？\r\n一起做的话，我预感会有新风吹来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4497a67c230c2509fd8d438d70e1e051575eda70dd0185c4d53b66b96e875e27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e5427ca1cf65de4d9280a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎到来，训练员。\r\n夜风中飘来的巧克力香味，\r\n让这次邀请也变得更值了",
      "source_fingerprint": "d911520768b1a152d4709decb4a714f1b09426a8786a6db76d9be461e23d227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9899e785a11bb9eb2ece6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打算和小真同学一起\r\n参加森林里动物们的晚会。\r\n训练也请务必一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23aed38749195129418aa0f88e1126185b4b26c59c8ffbcf2ec2ae13b0b64a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb46ca7618693bce3ce7f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当看到校门口那不输给春风的笔头菜，\r\n就会想自己也要成为那样的人……\r\n然后，便能从中得到勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8939dbdc92f6edfc3376726b60b009897b432c99fbfc94ddd15711961c28f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0836ff987a938b5dc88cc2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经把巧克力冰淇淋冷藏好了。\r\n为了不输给这大南风，\r\n卷起袖子大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99674214f0cb4d16efbaf9f6926173bdca77edc41d7b2d3a560e24d28ce2a24d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:642e028a22a49328cff98f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天森林的音乐会很愉快呢。\r\n金风越发华丽，\r\n我也不由得跟着哼唱起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59097a17dd27060efdfb559e9e8fac7a67070bd086dbfe0d4424df435ebafa51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42892e557efe12957aa3e3a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质同分给了我一些特制关东煮高汤。\r\n我的便当迎来了好风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc577ef0d0c820935acfe54502fda3689577e3ed964b5f522dbd42f0e027b608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b0a2bff8edb8f9fa4ed79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2250459b1d1298ed3c4c5066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4353ac54e47225a4b4c4c053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次去学园的胡萝卜田，\r\n都会忍不住深呼吸。\r\n新鲜土壤的浓郁香气闻起来真舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de57b13335be7a2fb29a0b678a724decb0d2b7f96b5eab6dfa80ded9e36f8bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b8ce5eccec25e1ad202cd78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼～哼哼～哼……♪\r\n从树叶间隙洒下的阳光随风晃动，\r\n看起来就像在跳舞一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b821f23d954ee2af9899a9e6b6af8fb5c934a52b2cf46d283d0ae34087112dcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44170db0d84d2b7288c08b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喔，涡轮似乎刚经过这附近。\r\n这里还隐约残留着\r\n强劲又喧闹的雄风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "262a4882b7194827697c562d7c5674fe7fef3daf3f01b1941468f9a26692fec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c355452f00e81d987ccee71f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那本书我究竟看到哪里了呢……\r\n风总是会翻动书页，\r\n让我不晓得自己看到哪一页。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc56193b4aedfc4375f3939d56ae1b079457e4c7c8d5452ef66530f7f8fcf28b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b579c90a2118e11903fd358b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使不知道种在花坛里的花\r\n叫什么名字……还是能看得出来\r\n种花的人是用爱在照顾它们的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ed9507af98ffa63b207c7a892a41f4c4097902988e2ff7e5b5430f29c1712",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73e29e14eb4a53cbe7e9615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这件衣服后，\r\n果然就会想跳舞呢……我喜欢跳舞，\r\n感觉能用自己的身体捕捉到风与光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83696de0ddf2464c142ce23f0f2f95e8b8ebbd91d6580b3ffb22581f5ecb1d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0e1769356cedc37168e849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起穿着这件衣服时，\r\n就能感受到令人愉悦的花风。\r\n我是不是也能变成花朵呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd1a59f185c58f0c42ea6a914eedff194fea37ce942ebcaa3f6062bb4601120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a29efe0ce391548f6707721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉只要穿上这件衣服，\r\n自己就会变成一阵看得见的风，\r\n内心也开始轻盈地舞动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd6c0f1057c86c01bbbc8d6f07ffd36004f1892f3715a28ef296e872d9379bc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f780b39d42ccd96fad469ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背上的缎带很棒吧。\r\n只要一跑起来，\r\n它就会随风飘动喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc41cea898b5da7e856a65b6ed4a15f6bf36e38f76b564928f6eb943f140e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03becd38b9f8f22854b8a06c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天稍微早起去跑步。\r\n晓风将我的睡意全都吹跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dee0596b2dd18b430d4bc88afd376b47fcaf8925e866276ffb90dfbde46af35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c939dab9f4210a0db199fd71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要去中庭还是顶楼？呵呵，\r\n一边感受风的吹拂\r\n一边享用的午餐最好吃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "263e5a50464ab42e29d112a3f841305df2dc1930bbe9379adeb10390671a5fb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d10f78f11f5386acdc6452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天回去时稍微绕个路吧。\r\n训练结束后暖烘烘的身子，\r\n用晚风吹凉是最棒的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d106da46dc84573fea309215712674f35b614b23a71b3d5831b14f9a72a792a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b886a1bfc2bc6d39a59e3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们宛如春初暖风……\r\n是宣告新季节来临的风。\r\n我也要向前迈进，不能输给她们……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6965c0af592835200ff626ede948a6bd70d7fe7683076593295be3c728f8999b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e023de7382a8318716d9e2e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前阵子有朋友约我晚上出门散步……\r\n咦？原来那是在试胆大会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a990baefa15285399425d2a2a3952a11f1bd89054aaec1c95fe26669150e950",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e186b673cc1ae31ecebe3715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "栗子、野菇、柿子和银杏……\r\n该用这些秋季的赠礼做什么好呢。\r\n你有什么想吃的东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f69703b550dee262503e6b0335bb444bca7207a10b3a27e90ef3c3c0cac4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7ad38afea93af004110b39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套……一定要穿吗？\r\n穿轻薄的衣服比较能感受到风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e895ee6fa51af26fcbb2664301a82b49aeae32c3b32ed6401bfff363f779af8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b586d8017e12386aee0d8c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生也同学教了我骑自行车。\r\n被扶着时感触到的风，\r\n散发着一种异国气息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c939225570cdbfc61da5dfe9ed7da8856505805e0a6bad334a8da6d3b52fdab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679985bf1b632eac31be4adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乱蓬蓬很喜欢诗歌剧同学，\r\n总是会围着她转。\r\n我都有点嫉妒了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "446a2f10abbeb4c0355429acffc2a671dfe549410496b7b92d1f072a3999c25d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab4d084061f3e112a0de6e82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想给奇迹同学所在医院的\r\n孩子们送去绿风……\r\n我采来了很多果实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33f5859b0fdedd707eedede80827deb271530a305449ac8171d43837c9c3d2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3366ea0d4494386c8913a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我带巧克力，红宝石同学带红茶\r\n的那场茶会，真是一阵美好光风。\r\n希望这样的日子还能再次到来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3944dbeacc90594032ec2a715d18a188dfe2d85344242e4db32e73103bf22c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e86085d97d931d27a7c203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弟弟有时会突然出现又飒爽地回去。\r\n虽然这光风我已经习以为常，\r\n但还是希望能多沐浴一会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ecd79f9ef8d351cf763776c1d323c3c553b5c9e9c74a29d71bcbf58a75f6e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14e10e31dc4c1ca20b7a2551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮同学的脚风从早上开始就状态绝佳。\r\n我也被激励着，\r\n不自觉地卷起了旋风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff19eb891252372dc8ba8699e9f2b47afd3b1b56a247a0380648d5a7bdabc82c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3189969ef3553546593f11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦了啊……\r\n作业被纯黑叼走了。要是\r\n能用小玻璃球换回来就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ee929d8b300fa767cd1a17c74c7087fccff10826465f74fbab5e9df886a7190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde47895cabb64c267133175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢像木贼草一样硬的牙刷。\r\n这样可以让我感受着口中的新风，\r\n安然入睡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55aaecfd1a1b55cc922b2f15fd1721f63aa9c5ac0fefe2760c724253c1a782e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0acfe826e65994b59505ef7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小尾巴干劲十足地养育着孩子呢。\r\n呵呵，今年也从远处默默守护吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3159406b0fb0b978042833bce8ebfa75de3124211333fea047fd5300628c18dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f222231ebdfdfc7067cc3d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天想在新绿的山间与河鱼嬉戏，\r\n然后游向大海化作一缕滨风。\r\n训练员，您觉得怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d55fc5b59e1859dbb7fd0b5e5675ac1022f643b20137ed0e4f15c03f988a06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65d77f97de03b4ff5483d0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时节，山林间处处人山人海。\r\n不如我们趁此间隙，\r\n去往那清风徐拂的秘密之地吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cb07729b196100284aa48c56abe10d59dc4ef6ea7dc10fb9fe71e4b768fa66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee2000375bf261ec67138b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是雪风的气息……\r\n我们一起来祈祷森林里的大家\r\n都平安无事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4478255ec9b4eaa0f6368d646fe661ba3c09a18d0b7ffda7ca0937e076c51939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d736d44dfb7f5acdf64d7a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袋子里装满了野草莓。\r\n是直接享用，还是做成果酱呢……\r\n真纠结啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2ac36ea9dcf843a07161fa36739e9c01637827ed93abba21fda90933b7a9cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a65f62095a659ca090eb9759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，该做点心了。大家都来成为\r\n甜美熏风的俘虏吧。呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af76b29a53ae4805577052c29891afdf8e61f147ca24c3ac5a5fd6d7a11eaeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c03c88806ffa6b9f5ee91dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随时都可以开始。\r\n现在已经吹起顺风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e700a7e75cf988c4ef954ecaad5648ace3f07c937622486cee886acde6908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41fdb246573824e28d18e821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0cd39e8ab13a0534fe536e26ed485fd90dd86a466ae02e0d34d4f971e33f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b7d3bbf887a880f9447059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始跑吧。\r\n趁现在还能听见疾风的耳语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6576c75076b50428cf7a389ec3c1ec4e6002f3dc962e3664375f7eb9986e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71cd98cfe11c62d4b832339",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竞赛须要做好各种准备。\r\n毕竟风是很善变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24294250b3f2bf98eba41ff70c099df2d697efe22b151dda8fbe346e441e15f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30653e6b2ac540818ed48034",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从平静到轻风，从轻风到暴风，\r\n然后总有一天，\r\n将化为席卷一切的猛烈风暴……",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ae0d0f38f3232d79960d3485c9239440791eae58742638ae1ef4c52cff26da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dc91824621a74bf2424702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉逐渐接近自己理想中的风了。\r\n我想，你一定就是那道顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6865ac391581e688e32e361d34113b93388960bc855630890e8217aea9735fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc29aada39ecf2dc5cd2797d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使遇到逆风也一定不会有事。\r\n因为现在训练员是我的顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf2148b43de6d9e3be8a855345bbf81fab3d21efeba97e031c3cf9d95a04096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef56894ab6216fa6b7a5194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起尽情跑到任何地方吧。\r\n我和你现在是同一道风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d1c9247584ec043c22cb0e39a2965ebf64fb51b3e05bc7d0445597dab11c73a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f605a6dfdd88291b54e07bfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是海的味道……能跟平常不会遇见的\r\n风一起奔跑，也算是夏天的乐趣。\r\n必须快点去跟风打招呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0c3131d89d15a2c2795d0ada2b299658441a09a0d1d40d072e26e4fbf4f017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319a18a404df732d8f4431f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要按照食谱，还是秘制奇味，\r\n不必做出抉择，随风而为吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90480118cb4f28687fc60f0a51260fb312d19545cfdb8e45b839eee1367b310c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40e105c990a59dc272f974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "课堂学习和器械训练都想\r\n伴着惠风进行。\r\n这个愿望，能为我实现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df682a3a41c32c6528bda6d3bda177047a8a76104955d68cf73ae6e0189f120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf699d1fb7a31b3e4342e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伸展一下，放松身体……啪嗒。\r\n试着模仿了一下软糯糯的动作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c782312128eb563f9ddb7872667cdfd866d6bfba2a985def181585d8bae632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d46b6a7bbb94758cce96c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闻到了秋风般浓郁的香气吗？\r\n呵呵，令人期待的茶点\r\n还需要再等一会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "309653e16a1b30f0c0bab28c3ee4a1b34e7b4daab0c3df5ee54375bdc45078f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2038211d6be3ebd62cdd4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是顺风放任自己的话，\r\n未免有些索然无味了。\r\n能否请教一下你的俄风呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3cdd55d9ddf6e544af8f9838e266d53c62aeae96da18ada804b1dde67811b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50bf7627b7c216f8bb4ddb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心和比赛都很重要。\r\n我们一起来携手掀起旋风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d0df1e6e89c6f8c8e929c8be015adda3adeaf7b0541324e3b1fd1d89c52821c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b4c79eb343d84b94813fbbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是被训练员充满感情的手风\r\n所邀请的话，不管去哪里，\r\n都请带着我前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff98f6fc621d7e4c4e126b59019f38cb309e4595fc87323b14a41d686957b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02276e9ffd9012cdd677724e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望你这道指引我的风，\r\n能一直在我身边吹拂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6002d7b28608f0649a07ef113f3df124cbf02786e2c8d643655808a30af367e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c38a32949dc97fd86323a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两个人一起的话，\r\n一定能吹到任何地方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f0b82dbd48da53cba2a3e738440fb38dbab48e1403269d36251f0f180095921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38bb59c0600a10c1a4dc77dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你微风轻抚般的温柔，\r\n已成为了我的重要之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c6e5d836054e136ec3b553c0d2ccf24ad6a69f7cced10b05ec64729db864a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1301c24cfe3be0bb1d8a610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝，\r\n来点甜甜甜的熏风怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1a57ac1587a06cfa4f44f982698455b624829955cd31041ab60d8e9749854d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0691186607934184d3d4ba18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是微风，只要持续吹下去……\r\n总有一天会变成风暴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "346de1229444aa3e3ef31d7aa89cd8330ae8ad8a4d5a9704cfa1158f77c1a6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441126a9e88f3ae233ab59c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一道疾风正在吹拂，\r\n几乎要超越那一天的风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6efbc2047d33b9ced02839b9e0f16211c23bafe3325811daf570989ec6af7175",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a8aec5bef8ca89a0b45f01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是也文摄辉，一起成为烈风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f30825b0ab269c3fb84cfbca570a6e330dd2ad07543054fef6667edaf086d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30eb1da53dc10af0863b0a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了超越那一天的风，\r\n我会驰骋于原野，吹拂而过……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a8746d229c4254940ad56a013f35772987865f79090051af793914fa8eedf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ec142092e79eb5a6864970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风将变得更快、更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "218e685b01ed33509147f01c24936428954027e09e68a491420a182d4ae4b1f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07d7398bfc6b4ceb700be2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春风定会在背后推我一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde742a8d9e586ed43d27afa301fcc587491e8f6eba50cc0eb61d8baa8679542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d29b7951805993262c78b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风味增强了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cbfde611d37170e3a53b12f641dddc5477524681062e7af74db001c0e7f24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428ade4fb8d072c3abb97e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这调料是顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e98608874f91afdb30ae2d9cb35b4155c6d2fabe923e9ba5074b079d065b1df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bc0b8587677b0e187237537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这承载着愿望的风能够传达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed9e1fbead84a8ec56350b88898cb72c55c997a7b8a9fc9aca35b88e2786f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a27f153887174796f3e7c3be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是也文摄辉。\r\n让思念随风而行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50979d672159619933da216d7bb760eb27697eae17017e95b8aa7d09128b90e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
